/ImageType 1
/Width 1024  /Height 1024
/BitsPerComponent 8
/Decode [0 1 0 1 0 1]
/ImageMatrix [1024 0 0 1024 0 0]
/DataSource currentfile /ASCII85Decode filter /FlateDecode filter 
